    { "id": 15, "timestamp": "2025-06-27T00:00:03", "date": "2025-06-27", "time": "00:00:03", "sender": "Jair Bolsonaro", "content": "esqueça qualquer crítica ao Gilmar", "type": "text", "is_edited": false, "attachment": null, "urls": [] },
    { "id": 16, "timestamp": "2025-07-07T00:00:00", "date": "2025-07-07", "time": "00:00:00", "sender": "Eduardo Bolsonaro", "content": "Se a anistia light passar, a última ajuda vinda dos EUA terá sido o post do Trump. Eles não irão mais ajudar", "type": "text", "is_edited": false, "attachment": null, "urls": [] },
    { "id": 17, "timestamp": "2025-07-07T00:00:01", "date": "2025-07-07", "time": "00:00:01", "sender": "Eduardo Bolsonaro", "content": "Temos que decidir entre ajudar o Brasil, brecar o STF e resgatar a democracia OU enviar o pessoal que esteve num protesto que evoluiu para uma baderna para casa num semiaberto", "type": "text", "is_edited": false, "attachment": null, "urls": [] },
    { "id": 18, "timestamp": "2025-07-07T00:00:02", "date": "2025-07-07", "time": "00:00:02", "sender": "Eduardo Bolsonaro", "content": "Neste cenário vc: não teria mais amparo dos EUA", "type": "text", "is_edited": false, "attachment": null, "urls": [] },
    { "id": 19, "timestamp": "2025-07-07T00:00:03", "date": "2025-07-07", "time": "00:00:03", "sender": "Eduardo Bolsonaro", "content": "Tire do cálculo o apoio dos EUA, qual estratégia vc tem para atingir qual objetivo? É simples.", "type": "text", "is_edited": false, "attachment": null, "urls": [] },
    { "id": 20, "timestamp": "2025-07-09T00:00:00", "date": "2025-07-09", "time": "00:00:00", "sender": "Eduardo Bolsonaro", "content": "Quase meia noite no Brasil e ele postou de novo", "type": "text", "is_edited": false, "attachment": null, "urls": [] },
    { "id": 21, "timestamp": "2025-07-09T00:00:01", "date": "2025-07-09", "time": "00:00:01", "sender": "Eduardo Bolsonaro", "content": "Me dá o ok, para eu enviar para a imprensa", "type": "text", "is_edited": false, "attachment": null, "urls": [] },
    { "id": 22, "timestamp": "2025-07-10T00:00:00", "date": "2025-07-10", "time": "00:00:00", "sender": "Eduardo Bolsonaro", "content": "O cara mais poderoso do mundo está a seu favor. Fizemos a nossa parte", "type": "text", "is_edited": false, "attachment": null, "urls": [] },
    { "id": 23, "timestamp": "2025-07-10T00:00:01", "date": "2025-07-10", "time": "00:00:01", "sender": "Jair Bolsonaro", "content": "[concordância]", "type": "text", "is_edited": false, "attachment": null, "urls": [] },
